OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGiant pumpkin may be linked to
OL,4,Amicroalgae research
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant pumpkin at a tourist attraction
OL,7,Fin Kent may be the by-product of some
OL,8,Funiversity research.
OL,10,FThe 420kg (66 stone) pumpkin was grown
OL,11,Fat the Secret Garden Centre in Quex
OL,12,FPark in Birchington, where a University
OL,13,Fof Kent-led project is looking into
OL,14,Fwhether microalgae can enrich animal
OL,15,Ffeed and soil to produce healthier
OL,16,Fplants and food.
OL,18,F"The site has been farming microalgae
OL,19,Fin a polytunnel and frequently used the
OL,20,Fneighbouring pumpkin patch to dump any
OL,21,Fexcess algae," a university
OL,22,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
