OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGiant pumpkin may be linked to
OL,4,Amicroalgae research
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whilst the pumpkin was not part of the
OL,7,Fcontrolled experiments, its size and
OL,8,Fquality does suggest that the
OL,9,Fmicroalgae may have had a role in its
OL,10,Fgrowth."
